WEBVTT

00:03.690 --> 00:05.280
It's early summer.

00:05.280 --> 00:08.050
Or should I call it
the plum rain season?

00:08.470 --> 00:11.970
My hypothesis is mostly correct.

00:11.970 --> 00:15.330
The misty door you last used

00:15.330 --> 00:18.080
affected the weather in the Subspace.

00:18.710 --> 00:21.000
The weather keeps changing.

00:21.000 --> 00:22.090
It's hard for me to store the food.

00:22.090 --> 00:24.550
MOULDY
It's hard for me to store the food.

00:25.260 --> 00:29.430
The people here haven't
been greatly affected so far.

00:29.880 --> 00:30.510
However,

00:31.340 --> 00:35.190
there could be a sudden thunderstorm
or a scorching hot sun.

00:35.190 --> 00:35.970
As I suspected,

00:36.520 --> 00:39.100
a certain level of regularity
is much needed.

00:39.610 --> 00:41.440
Just like Japan, where I used to live.

00:42.440 --> 00:46.290
By collecting data
from the Young Master's mana,

00:46.290 --> 00:49.200
I noticed that the link between
the misty door and the weather

00:49.200 --> 00:51.910
is mostly predictable.

00:52.450 --> 00:55.160
I'll go and look for spots

00:55.160 --> 00:57.970
where the four seasons
can change effortlessly.

00:57.970 --> 00:58.870
I'm counting on you.

00:59.410 --> 01:02.290
I need to head back to Rotsgard.

01:02.290 --> 01:04.340
Don't get reckless while I'm gone.

01:06.380 --> 01:10.470
Young Master, are you leaving again?

01:11.300 --> 01:12.510
Yeah.

01:12.510 --> 01:16.760
But I'll come home as often as I can
when I have the time.

01:21.310 --> 01:25.980
The May rain makes me reluctant to leave.

01:45.590 --> 01:51.550
TSUKIMICHI -MOONLIT FANTASY- SEASON 2

02:56.390 --> 02:58.490
NIGHT 8: THE NOTORIOUS SISTERS

02:58.490 --> 03:00.740
KUZUNOHA
Welcome back, Young Master.

03:00.740 --> 03:03.620
LOADED
Please accept this.

03:04.120 --> 03:06.080
Thank you.

03:06.960 --> 03:09.290
I feel like a greedy officer.

03:10.000 --> 03:12.590
The business has been doing well.

03:13.800 --> 03:16.720
It's time to have more shopkeepers.

03:17.220 --> 03:18.760
You both did great.

03:19.140 --> 03:21.010
Here, your reward.

03:21.340 --> 03:23.980
Is... Is this even real?

03:23.980 --> 03:26.480
No. It's the real deal.

03:26.480 --> 03:28.270
Yellow, yellow, happy.

03:29.060 --> 03:30.770
Withdrawal symptoms?

03:30.770 --> 03:32.730
Banana addiction is scary.

03:35.860 --> 03:38.280
We need special permission
for the lesson today.

03:38.280 --> 03:40.160
I got the permit.

03:40.780 --> 03:42.830
There should be no problem.

03:43.330 --> 03:44.770
Mr. Kuzunoha.

03:45.500 --> 03:47.250
Can I have a word?

03:47.250 --> 03:49.250
Hey there, Mr. Blight.

03:49.880 --> 03:55.760
Could you sell me ten jars
of the external wound ointment you sell?

03:56.550 --> 03:59.930
During the time between summer break
and the school anniversary,

03:59.930 --> 04:03.720
some of my students come to class
with their wounds.

04:04.430 --> 04:06.480
Sure.
Glad to do business with you.

04:06.480 --> 04:07.730
Great.

04:07.730 --> 04:09.270
I've tried it myself.

04:09.270 --> 04:11.190
It worked wonders.

04:11.190 --> 04:12.730
It's very affordable too.

04:13.320 --> 04:14.440
Thank you.

04:15.490 --> 04:17.350
We sell other items too.

04:17.350 --> 04:18.649
Feel free to browse around.

04:19.029 --> 04:21.029
Of course.
I'll drop by sometimes.

04:24.410 --> 04:27.410
We've gained
quite a reputation in school, too.

04:27.410 --> 04:29.370
All thanks to your promotion.

04:29.840 --> 04:32.080
I hope he's not reselling them
to make a profit.

04:34.920 --> 04:36.960
I'll check these for you.

04:36.960 --> 04:39.880
Could you go through
the important documents first?

04:39.880 --> 04:41.340
I'm saved.

04:41.340 --> 04:44.010
They may be worthless proposals,
but this is utterly a prank.

04:44.450 --> 04:47.730
That said, the proposals you get seem
to have far more effort put into them.

04:48.310 --> 04:51.280
The students' applications.

04:51.280 --> 04:52.060
Thanks.

04:53.360 --> 04:55.650
Let's see.
There are three of them.

04:55.650 --> 04:57.990
One of them is Karen Fors.

04:57.990 --> 04:58.900
And...

04:59.280 --> 05:01.110
Wait... Huh?

05:01.610 --> 05:03.690
Are these two...

05:08.410 --> 05:10.630
Three more will join the class today.

05:11.080 --> 05:12.290
Introduce yourselves.

05:16.300 --> 05:18.090
I am Sif Rembrandt.

05:18.630 --> 05:21.210
I was away due to my sickness.

05:21.830 --> 05:25.760
Until I return to my prime,
I might be a trouble for you guys.

05:25.760 --> 05:26.890
I hope you won't mind.

05:27.890 --> 05:30.230
As you can see, I am a human.

05:30.230 --> 05:32.230
I specialize in offensive magic.

05:32.230 --> 05:33.650
My elements are earth and fire.

05:34.230 --> 05:37.110
I also have the protection of earth spirits.

05:41.240 --> 05:42.990
I am Yuno Rembrandt.

05:42.990 --> 05:44.490
I'm Sif's younger sister.

05:44.490 --> 05:46.370
I'm back to school again today.

05:46.370 --> 05:48.190
A human too.

05:48.190 --> 05:49.450
I'll give this class my best.

05:50.120 --> 05:52.400
I'm skilled at physical combat

05:52.400 --> 05:55.750
as the center guard or further back
rather than the vanguard.

05:55.750 --> 05:59.170
Depending on the situation,
I can be an archer or a lancer.

05:59.960 --> 06:02.590
I can use magic to boost my attacks,

06:02.590 --> 06:03.760
but I'm not skilled at it.

06:05.180 --> 06:08.640
I'm glad both of them
have made a full recovery.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.020
I am Karen Fors.

06:14.980 --> 06:18.230
I'm a transfer student
from Foosk Royal Academy.

06:18.230 --> 06:19.820
A human.

06:19.820 --> 06:21.690
I have an affinity with water.

06:21.690 --> 06:23.440
This girl...

06:26.320 --> 06:28.200
Let's get along.

06:28.200 --> 06:30.120
Rembrandt sisters.

06:30.120 --> 06:30.620
Yes.

06:31.120 --> 06:35.250
Your father is a friend of mine,
but no special treatment here.

06:35.250 --> 06:36.130
Keep that in mind.

06:36.420 --> 06:37.630
Of course.

06:38.210 --> 06:39.590
What is going on?

06:39.590 --> 06:41.920
They are different
from what I used to know.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.880
No. Don't let them fool you.

06:44.300 --> 06:46.640
I bet they are just pretending.

06:46.640 --> 06:48.640
Something weird about their attitude.

06:49.260 --> 06:51.680
The sisters seem
to be very notorious at school.

06:51.680 --> 06:54.210
They used to be very proud
of their wealth and good looks.

06:54.210 --> 06:55.980
The two were rude and rebellious.

06:56.900 --> 06:58.930
I can't tell at all.

06:59.770 --> 07:01.780
Banana! Banana!

07:02.230 --> 07:06.130
For today's lesson,
I've prepared an interesting activity.

07:07.030 --> 07:09.370
The three new students
will wait by the side.

07:09.370 --> 07:10.660
The rest of you, follow me.

07:12.540 --> 07:13.580
I need you

07:13.580 --> 07:16.620
to fight the opponent
I'm about to summon.

07:16.620 --> 07:17.630
A summon?

07:18.080 --> 07:20.540
He can even use summoning magic?

07:20.540 --> 07:23.210
Just how many times
are we going to get wiped out?

07:23.210 --> 07:25.930
We might not live to be
at the next lesson.

07:25.930 --> 07:29.100
I'd hate to let the three of them
see how useless we are.

07:29.720 --> 07:30.640
Here it comes.

07:31.140 --> 07:31.930
Stay focused.

07:34.890 --> 07:37.350
A lizardman we've never seen before.

07:38.350 --> 07:40.360
Is it very strong?

07:40.360 --> 07:41.770
I can't tell you.

07:41.770 --> 07:45.030
But he is my friend, Blue Lizard.

07:45.490 --> 07:46.570
Blue Lizard?

07:47.070 --> 07:48.610
I'm counting on you today.

07:48.610 --> 07:49.780
Don't use "Breathe."

07:49.780 --> 07:51.830
Use only 20 percent of your strength.

07:52.080 --> 07:53.410
Let's begin.

07:53.410 --> 07:54.120
Relax.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.790
Fight hard, and you will survive.

07:56.370 --> 07:58.620
Such is life.

07:59.210 --> 08:01.090
Banana! Banana!

08:01.790 --> 08:04.510
The three new students will fight me.

08:04.510 --> 08:05.380
That being said,

08:05.380 --> 08:07.260
only you will be attacking.

08:08.050 --> 08:11.330
I'll talk about the combat situation
and topics from time to time.

08:11.330 --> 08:13.260
It's brushtalk, so don't miss it.

08:14.390 --> 08:16.850
If you don't improve upon your flaws,

08:16.850 --> 08:19.350
I'll decimate your attacks
starting the second time.

08:19.350 --> 08:21.230
Be ready to get injured.

08:23.430 --> 08:24.650
- It's so strong!
- Darn it!

08:26.940 --> 08:27.610
Bring it on.

08:29.410 --> 08:32.620
Oh, great goddess,
grant me the miracle of fire!

08:32.950 --> 08:35.080
Come to life, the forever-freezing ice.

08:35.080 --> 08:37.330
Let me mimic your power.

08:40.750 --> 08:42.840
Too weak.
Very disappointing.

08:48.430 --> 08:51.260
Infuse the attack with mana
and increase your physical strength.

08:51.260 --> 08:53.010
Next time, I'll burn the attack away.

08:53.010 --> 08:54.050
Flame Ray!

08:58.560 --> 09:00.060
Frost Break!

09:02.520 --> 09:03.690
Well done.

09:03.690 --> 09:06.570
Karen has a good sense
of the time gap of casting.

09:06.570 --> 09:09.070
Sif even thought about
tricking her opponent.

09:13.140 --> 09:15.590
Sif, have some control over
the intensity of the battle.

09:15.590 --> 09:16.650
Raise your speed.

09:17.200 --> 09:20.000
Karen should focus on her output strength
and effect duration.

09:22.570 --> 09:23.420
Yuno.

09:23.420 --> 09:25.990
Your physical boosting
and mana infusion are unrefined.

09:27.210 --> 09:29.920
You are too eager to unleash
a powerful shot.

09:29.920 --> 09:31.860
That makes your shots very crude.

09:31.860 --> 09:32.800
You failed the test.

09:33.430 --> 09:34.720
Use your lance next.

09:34.720 --> 09:35.550
Yes.

09:35.550 --> 09:38.680
The next attack will be
a bit more serious.

09:39.310 --> 09:43.270
This is going to be
an unforgettable defeat for all of you,

09:44.020 --> 09:47.230
but it's always better
to experience a failure early on.

09:53.160 --> 09:55.120
Wind, grant me my wish!

09:55.120 --> 09:57.870
Clear the obstacle in front of me!

09:59.080 --> 10:00.080
Abelia!

10:00.830 --> 10:04.000
Pierce my enemy, Flame Lance!

10:06.670 --> 10:07.630
I got you!

10:14.640 --> 10:16.470
That's all for the lesson today.

10:17.050 --> 10:20.270
Write a report about
why you failed and submit it to me.

10:20.680 --> 10:23.270
Karen, something still concerns me.

10:23.270 --> 10:24.230
Come with me.

10:24.650 --> 10:25.390
Yes.

10:28.730 --> 10:30.110
I thought I'd die back there.

10:30.110 --> 10:33.200
- Lizards are scary...
- What's the deal with that lizardman?

10:33.200 --> 10:36.070
- Lizards are scary...
- I can only think about how strong it was.

10:36.620 --> 10:38.410
That was totally a dragon.

10:38.410 --> 10:40.580
Did Mr. Kuzunoha summon a dragon?

10:40.830 --> 10:42.500
Sister!

10:42.500 --> 10:45.290
Yuno, you mustn't cry like a weakling.

10:45.790 --> 10:47.210
All right.

10:47.210 --> 10:52.010
Mr. Kuzunoha will never set an obstacle
that can't be overcome.

10:52.010 --> 10:53.760
I can guarantee that.

10:54.340 --> 10:56.010
Are you sure?

10:56.010 --> 10:58.720
He seemed to enjoy it.

10:58.720 --> 11:00.720
It's a fact that he is strict.

11:00.720 --> 11:03.680
That also means
he has high hopes for all of you.

11:03.680 --> 11:06.230
Personally, I envy you for that.

11:06.770 --> 11:09.360
Mr. Shiki, are you the kind
that gets more spirited

11:09.360 --> 11:10.900
the more people pick on you?

11:10.900 --> 11:11.940
No.

11:12.440 --> 11:16.660
No. It's been some time
since he had any expectations for me.

11:16.990 --> 11:18.000
Touched.

11:19.410 --> 11:21.580
Are you two able to continue?

11:22.200 --> 11:24.580
Yuno and I will be fine.

11:24.580 --> 11:26.540
We are not giving up just yet.

11:27.040 --> 11:29.750
Everybody, we look forward
to becoming stronger together.

11:29.750 --> 11:31.300
Oh, sure.

11:31.300 --> 11:32.500
Same here.

11:33.300 --> 11:34.190
If you don't mind,

11:34.190 --> 11:36.260
we could exchange thoughts
about the lesson.

11:37.260 --> 11:38.220
Sure!

11:38.220 --> 11:40.850
I'm glad I set an empty period
after this just to be safe,

11:40.850 --> 11:41.720
Sister.

11:43.270 --> 11:44.720
How should I put it...

11:45.180 --> 11:47.190
People do change.

11:48.190 --> 11:51.520
Sir, what is your concern?

11:51.520 --> 11:53.250
Your strength is unusual.

11:53.250 --> 11:55.070
It's not the normal level for a student.

11:55.650 --> 11:58.530
After all, I serve as a mage in the army.

11:59.370 --> 12:00.280
If you have doubts,

12:00.280 --> 12:02.430
I can tell you which unit I served in.

12:02.830 --> 12:05.160
I checked your background.

12:05.160 --> 12:07.870
In that case,
why do you still suspect me?

12:07.870 --> 12:11.130
I'm just wondering
if you're the real Karen Fors.

12:13.800 --> 12:15.340
That's a weird joke.

12:15.340 --> 12:17.760
Of course I am the real Karen.

12:18.840 --> 12:23.470
Perhaps you'd like to know me even better.

12:23.970 --> 12:25.020
In that case...

12:26.810 --> 12:28.980
What is a demon doing in our academy?

12:30.230 --> 12:31.730
You don't have horns,

12:31.730 --> 12:33.530
but the skin and eye color won't lie.

12:34.020 --> 12:36.440
You are, without a doubt, a demon.

12:37.320 --> 12:39.780
Sir, please take a good look.

12:40.410 --> 12:42.620
Which part of me looks like a demon?

12:45.160 --> 12:48.790
You can't charm me,
horn-less demon.

12:51.290 --> 12:54.690
I didn't think my cover
would be blown so soon.

12:55.090 --> 12:55.710
However,

12:56.630 --> 12:58.920
do not call me horn-less.

13:00.020 --> 13:01.430
I might kill you for that.

13:01.840 --> 13:04.100
So, the real Karen is indeed...

13:04.100 --> 13:07.180
Yes, but it wasn't my doing.

13:07.180 --> 13:08.890
It was her friend.

13:09.480 --> 13:11.900
I see. Poor girl.

13:11.900 --> 13:13.610
How frosty.

13:14.230 --> 13:16.030
Aren't you a human?

13:16.030 --> 13:19.150
I thought you'd have the urge
to kill demons on sight.

13:19.150 --> 13:20.070
I...

13:21.450 --> 13:23.030
Darn it, this is too much trouble.

13:23.490 --> 13:25.550
I am against any form of discrimination.

13:26.040 --> 13:29.330
As long as we understand each other,
your race is not a concern.

13:29.330 --> 13:31.500
You can speak our language.

13:31.500 --> 13:33.750
I speak every language
except the Common Tongue.

13:33.750 --> 13:35.500
So, what should I call you?

13:36.840 --> 13:38.460
You don't need to know.

13:38.960 --> 13:40.340
I see.

13:42.010 --> 13:44.720
Yes. I must get rid of you.

13:44.720 --> 13:47.060
Otherwise, you'd get in my way.

13:47.060 --> 13:48.660
Her name is Rona.

13:50.640 --> 13:54.230
One of the four generals
of the Demon Army.

13:54.230 --> 13:54.980
What...

13:55.770 --> 13:57.320
Shiki, do you know her?

13:57.320 --> 13:58.390
Yes.

13:58.390 --> 14:00.530
I made her acquaintance
when I was still a lich.

14:00.530 --> 14:03.740
She probably doesn't recognize me.

14:03.740 --> 14:05.280
It's best not to tell her.

14:06.530 --> 14:08.450
As a merchant,

14:08.450 --> 14:11.250
information is more
important than anything.

14:11.830 --> 14:15.130
I have the upper hand in terms of
numbers and information.

14:17.840 --> 14:21.300
Indeed.
I'm in a hairy situation.

14:21.970 --> 14:23.880
Let's not stand here.

14:23.880 --> 14:25.260
We'll talk somewhere else.

14:27.050 --> 14:28.350
This tastes amazing.

14:28.350 --> 14:31.310
I pour my heart and soul
into growing those!

14:31.310 --> 14:32.310
FIVE IRONS

14:32.310 --> 14:33.270
FIVE IRONS
This tastes incredible!

14:33.270 --> 14:35.770
Get your hands off my cream hotpot!

14:35.770 --> 14:36.150
Die!

14:36.730 --> 14:38.320
Calm down.
Don't fight.

14:38.320 --> 14:38.860
Please?

14:40.150 --> 14:41.940
Sorry we have to talk while you eat.

14:41.940 --> 14:43.570
Let's continue our conversation.

14:43.570 --> 14:44.570
Our conversation...

14:45.820 --> 14:49.240
I'd like to know more
about the Kuzunoha Company.

14:49.240 --> 14:51.790
You have an outlet
in Tsige of Aion too, right?

14:52.200 --> 14:53.750
You're well-informed.

14:53.750 --> 14:56.580
So, are you an intelligence agency there?

14:56.580 --> 14:57.750
No way.

14:57.750 --> 14:59.960
We don't belong to any faction.

14:59.960 --> 15:01.760
Not to any human or demon.

15:02.260 --> 15:05.470
Hold on. Are you aware
of what you're saying?

15:05.970 --> 15:08.140
There's no need to be so shocked.

15:09.050 --> 15:12.180
I bet some humans
have already defected to your side.

15:12.980 --> 15:16.600
So, is it really that surprising
that some remain neutral?

15:16.600 --> 15:20.480
I see. This is why you're
collecting information.

15:21.310 --> 15:23.030
More importantly, what's your motive?

15:24.280 --> 15:26.360
Why are you infiltrating our school?

15:26.660 --> 15:28.700
Don't give me that nasty look.

15:28.700 --> 15:30.240
I don't plan on fighting you.

15:31.290 --> 15:35.000
But she has no qualms about
charming or seducing her targets.

15:35.290 --> 15:36.750
Don't let your guard down.

15:36.750 --> 15:37.960
UPSET

15:37.960 --> 15:39.670
Delicious.

15:39.670 --> 15:42.920
Never underestimate its potential
just because it's half-cooked.

15:43.420 --> 15:45.720
You mentioned remaining neutral.

15:45.720 --> 15:48.590
Are you trying to be an arms dealer?

15:48.590 --> 15:49.330
Nope.

15:49.800 --> 15:52.890
I don't want anyone
to get in the way of my business.

15:53.390 --> 15:57.850
Is that so? I still can't trust you,
but I understand your intention.

15:58.310 --> 16:02.820
First off, you and I should
get to know each other better.

16:03.230 --> 16:04.170
Huh?

16:04.170 --> 16:05.280
Hate to break it to you,

16:05.280 --> 16:07.650
but you will spend
the rest of your life in regret

16:07.650 --> 16:09.780
if you ever have bodily contact
with Mr. Kuzunoha.

16:11.070 --> 16:12.740
So this is what she means...

16:13.040 --> 16:14.240
What a shame.

16:14.240 --> 16:16.680
I was hoping to get to know you better.

16:17.250 --> 16:19.540
Your lesson alone isn't enough.

16:20.580 --> 16:24.710
Mr. Kuzunoha's strength is boundless.
You failed to notice even one bit.

16:25.170 --> 16:28.050
So, can you answer my question now?

16:28.470 --> 16:30.720
The motive of my infiltration?

16:31.510 --> 16:32.260
The goal...

16:33.180 --> 16:38.230
is to investigate and take care of
the secret human experiment in this city.

16:41.480 --> 16:43.190
Long time no see, Young Master.

16:43.520 --> 16:46.150
Erm... You must be...

16:46.150 --> 16:48.150
You forgot my name?

16:48.490 --> 16:50.950
It's Raim. Raim Rateh.

16:50.950 --> 16:51.620
Oh...

16:51.620 --> 16:52.320
BEFORE

16:52.320 --> 16:54.080
BEFORE
That guy with the awful name.

16:54.490 --> 16:56.790
You remember me now.

16:57.500 --> 17:00.620
As I recall, you are Tomoe's spy.

17:00.620 --> 17:01.670
Yes.

17:01.670 --> 17:04.750
She asked me to give you a hand.

17:05.210 --> 17:08.220
I need you to investigate something
in this city for me.

17:09.470 --> 17:12.180
Several demi-humans have been abducted.

17:12.180 --> 17:14.890
There seem to be activities
of human trafficking.

17:15.970 --> 17:17.930
The Assassin Guild is involved as well.

17:19.390 --> 17:21.599
I was ambushed once.

17:21.900 --> 17:23.900
The intel should be credible.

17:24.190 --> 17:27.319
They are going to be a problem
if that's true.

17:27.319 --> 17:29.240
I'll find some dirt on them.

17:29.860 --> 17:32.280
Can you two help out after work?

17:32.700 --> 17:34.780
You want us to work overtime?

17:34.780 --> 17:35.830
What a bummer.

17:36.740 --> 17:38.870
I'll throw in a little extra reward.

17:38.870 --> 17:39.790
We're game!

17:41.600 --> 17:42.790
Young Master.

17:42.790 --> 17:46.500
It'd be wise not to take
Rona's every word for it.

17:46.500 --> 17:47.880
Understood.

17:48.510 --> 17:51.530
So, what's your relationship with her?

17:51.530 --> 17:55.140
We are partners who exchange information.

17:55.680 --> 17:56.970
FRUSTRATED
But she used me

17:56.970 --> 17:59.100
FRUSTRATED
and got me into all kinds of trouble.

17:59.930 --> 18:02.690
She owes the Demon King a great deal.

18:02.690 --> 18:05.270
So, she fanatically pledged
her loyalty to the Demon King.

18:05.270 --> 18:07.070
She's not as strong as Lady Mio,

18:07.070 --> 18:10.150
but you can think of her
as a dubious version of Lady Mio.

18:10.150 --> 18:11.570
That should give you an idea.

18:11.570 --> 18:13.110
DONG~

18:13.110 --> 18:14.780
DONG~
Huh? What? That sounds scary!

18:15.620 --> 18:18.620
We should monitor her movements.

18:18.620 --> 18:20.250
Of course.
It's already been done.

18:20.750 --> 18:23.960
All right.
Time to pay a visit.

18:24.580 --> 18:26.880
The present is ready.

18:26.880 --> 18:29.710
TOUCHED
Sorry for the trouble, Mr. Shiki.

18:30.840 --> 18:33.510
This is the girls' dorm
where the aristocrats live.

18:33.510 --> 18:37.600
Mr. Rembrandt must
really love his daughters.

18:38.060 --> 18:38.810
Indeed.

18:38.810 --> 18:41.310
It took great effort
to get the permission to visit.

18:41.980 --> 18:43.350
Are you saying...

18:43.350 --> 18:45.810
The paperwork was a chore.

18:45.810 --> 18:48.400
But of course, no lingering symptoms.

18:48.400 --> 18:49.520
DONG~

18:49.520 --> 18:51.360
DONG~
Huh? What? That sounds scary!

18:53.950 --> 18:56.320
I couldn't visit
when you were unwell.

18:56.320 --> 18:57.530
Sorry about that.

18:58.280 --> 19:01.870
Congratulations on making a full recovery.

19:01.870 --> 19:03.540
Huh...

19:03.540 --> 19:05.500
You seem different in class.

19:06.330 --> 19:09.130
I get strict unknowingly in class.

19:10.170 --> 19:14.170
Please don't tell the others
about my visit.

19:16.720 --> 19:20.510
Master Kuzunoha, you saved our lives.

19:20.510 --> 19:22.600
We can never thank you enough.

19:22.600 --> 19:25.940
My sister and I are alive and well,

19:25.940 --> 19:27.670
thanks to your help.

19:27.670 --> 19:28.860
If there is anything I...

19:28.860 --> 19:32.360
If there's anything we can do to help,
do let us know.

19:32.900 --> 19:35.140
They are very grateful to me.

19:35.570 --> 19:37.820
So, Yuno uses
the masculine pronoun for "I."

19:38.990 --> 19:43.120
Please live a happy and fulfilling life.

19:43.120 --> 19:45.080
Stop calling me Master Kuzunoha.

19:45.080 --> 19:46.620
Just "teacher" or "sir" will do.

19:46.620 --> 19:47.920
But...

19:48.670 --> 19:51.460
You're finally freed from the curse.

19:51.460 --> 19:54.460
A life bound by gratitude
will be very dull.

19:55.340 --> 19:56.590
Understood.

19:56.590 --> 19:57.750
That's a promise.

19:58.430 --> 20:01.680
Do not go back on your words
because I look ugly.

20:02.350 --> 20:04.720
When you were sick...

20:04.720 --> 20:07.560
Please don't bring that up!

20:07.560 --> 20:10.150
It's even more embarrassing
than letting you see us naked!

20:10.820 --> 20:16.110
By the way, your father mentioned
recording your journey of recovery.

20:18.280 --> 20:24.770
We and our mother have convinced him
to reflect on his foolish mistake.

20:25.330 --> 20:27.790
Moris has been punished
for his careless mistake

20:27.790 --> 20:30.290
of forcing us to attend your class.

20:30.290 --> 20:31.630
DONG~

20:31.630 --> 20:33.250
DONG~
Huh? What? That sounds scary!

20:34.050 --> 20:35.050
I see.

20:35.920 --> 20:38.540
Now I know how the rumors started.

20:42.220 --> 20:44.180
The Rembrandt sisters.

20:44.180 --> 20:46.480
They are human aristocrats,

20:46.480 --> 20:49.900
but they don't seem
to let their appearances bother them.

20:49.900 --> 20:51.560
I find that hard to believe.

20:51.560 --> 20:54.400
They both suffered a great deal
because of the curse.

20:55.190 --> 20:59.450
Did that help with their
notorious behaviors?

21:00.240 --> 21:03.620
When you think about it,
the curse had a silver lining, after all.

21:04.370 --> 21:06.580
They will grow up well.

21:08.250 --> 21:10.280
I look forward to seeing
these rookies shine.

21:11.170 --> 21:13.590
I hope they have a bright future ahead.

21:13.590 --> 21:16.510
But the world is cruel.

21:18.010 --> 21:20.850
Where there is light,
there will be darkness.

21:22.970 --> 21:24.680
Human experiment...

21:25.140 --> 21:28.640
You won't learn anything
about the abductions here!

21:37.940 --> 21:40.320
Is this part of the academy's compound?

21:41.910 --> 21:44.070
The area is being renovated.

21:49.700 --> 21:51.830
The clothes look new.

21:57.170 --> 21:58.130
Stop right there.

21:59.130 --> 22:01.010
Unless you have a death wish.

23:35.440 --> 23:38.590
NEXT EPISODE: PERVY DRAGON
Night 9: "Pervy Dragon."
